---
// Contract Section Component
---

<section id="contract" class="py-20 bg-warm-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-forest-dark mb-6">
          Our Agricultural Partnership Process
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-forest-dark/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          We believe in transparent, fair, and flexible partnerships that work for both farmers and our team. 
          Our streamlined process ensures you get exactly the agricultural solutions you need.
        </p>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-fresh-green rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">1</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-forest-dark mb-2">Farm Assessment</h3>
              <p class="text-forest-dark/80">We visit your farm to understand your specific needs, challenges, and agricultural goals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-fresh-green rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">2</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-forest-dark mb-2">Solution Proposal</h3>
              <p class="text-forest-dark/80">We create a detailed agricultural solution proposal with clear deliverables and farming timelines.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-fresh-green rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">3</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-forest-dark mb-2">Implementation & Support</h3>
              <p class="text-forest-dark/80">We work closely with you throughout the farming season, providing ongoing support and optimization.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-sage-light/30 rounded-natural p-8 shadow-natural border border-sage">
        <div class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9">
          <div class="bg-sage-light rounded-natural flex items-center justify-center h-64">
            <span class="text-forest-dark/60">Agricultural Partnership Process</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
